span> Life Drain</span> (15-27)<div class=\"abilityScene\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"scene_table canvas\" style=\"padding:32px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"tibiatext caster_name\">Ghoul</div><div class=\"hp_bar\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"caster-south\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20260719050902&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Ghoul_8f4d49.gif\"/></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect no_effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"missile_area\" data-horiz=\"100\" data-vert=\"100\" style=\"width:100%;height:100%;\">\n<div data-anim-dir=\"south-east\" style=\"position:relative;padding:0;width: 32px;height: 32px;z-index:2;animation:south-east 1s infinite !important;\">\n<div class=\"sprite\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20180903194017&amp;path-prefix=en&amp;frame=4\" class=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Death_Missile_d0d282.gif\"/></div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n</div></td>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"target\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n</div>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table></div></div>⁠, <div class=\"creatureAbility abilityWithScene\"><span style=\"white-space: nowrap\"><span class=\"icon\"><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span title=\"Healing\"><img alt=\"Healing\" class=\"mw-file-element\" height=\"9\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/wiki/Healing_Icon_be4df6.gif\" width=\"9\"/></span></span></span> Self-Healing</span> (9-15)<div class=\"abilityScene\"><table cellspacing=\"0\" class=\"scene_table canvas\" style=\"padding:32px;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n<div class=\"tile\">\n<div class=\"tibiatext caster_name\">Ghoul</div><div class=\"hp_bar\"></div>\n<div class=\"effect\"></div>\n<div class=\"caster-south\"><img alt=\"latest?cb=20260719050902&amp;path-prefix=en\" class=\"\" loading=\"laz