ture-resistance-bar2\" style=\"border-width:1px 1px 1px 1px; width:80.0000%; background-color:#ffffff; left:0.0000%;\"></div><div class=\"creature-resistance-pct\" style=\"position:absolute; right:calc(5px + 20.0000%); display:inline-block;\">100%</div></div></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Ancient%20Temple\">Ancient Temple</a> in the <a href=\"#/wiki/Skeleton\">Skeleton</a> area, way to <a href=\"#/wiki/Mintwallin\">Mintwallin</a>, <a href=\"#/quest/kingdom-of-kormarak-quest\">Old Mintwallin Quest</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Alatar%20Lake\">Alatar Lake</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Magician%20Tower\">Magician Tower</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Mount%20Sternum%2FUndead%20Cave\">Mount Sternum Undead Cave</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghostlands\">Ghostlands</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Hellgate\">Hellgate</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Maze%20of%20Lost%20Souls\">Maze of Lost Souls</a>, below Point of No Return in <a href=\"#/wiki/Outlaw%20Camp\">Outlaw Camp</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Plains%20of%20Havoc\">Plains of Havoc</a> in <a href=\"#/wiki/Necromant%20House\">Necromant House</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Drefia\">Drefia</a>'s underground caves, <a href=\"#/wiki/Edron\">Edron</a> <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghoul%20Hill\">ghoul hill</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore%20Amazon%20Camp\">Venore Amazon Camp</a> underground, <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a> Swamp Troll cave, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ghostship\">Ghostship</a> between <a href=\"#/wiki/Venore\">Venore</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Darashia\">Darashia</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Triangle%20Tower\">Triangle Tower</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Dark%20Cathedral\">Dark Cathedral</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Ankrahmun\">Ankrahmun</a> tombs, <a href=\"#/wiki/Forgotten%20Tomb\">Forgotten Tomb</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Isle%20of%20the%20Kings\">Isle of the Kings</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Treasure%20Island\">Treasure Island</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Nargor%20Undead%20Cave\">Nargor Undead Cave</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Helheim\">Helheim</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/Lion%27s%20Rock\">Lion's Rock</a>, <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Witches%27%20Cliff\">The Witches' Cliff</a> (only accessible during a <a href=\"#/quest/the-inquisition-quest\">quest</a>), a cave northeast of  <a href=\"#/wiki/Ab%27Dendriel\">Ab'Dendriel</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/The%20Cave\">The Cave</a>. Also found behind a wall in both <a href=\"#/wiki/Rookgaard\">Rookgaard</a> and <a href=\"#/wiki/Paradox%20Tower\">Paradox Tower</a>, although they cannot be reached.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tA ghoul attacks in melee range. A ghoul never retreats.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>With the Christmas Update 2009 Ghouls stopped dropping <a href=\"#/wiki/Brass%20Helmet\">Brass Helmets</a> (worth 30 gp ~19% loot chance) but drop Rotten Pieces of Cloth now (worth 30 gp ~20% loot chance).</li>\n<li>As announced on March 04, 2025, the patch added a \"very rare\" chance of looting <a href=\"#/wiki/Stone%20Skin%20Amulet\">Stone Skin Amulet</a> from this creature.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 11,247 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><spa